<div class="row"><label>Retained source pair<select id="inputs"><option value="">Select source files</option></select></label><button id="open-input">Open source pair</button><button id="older-inputs">Older source pairs</button><button id="latest-inputs">Latest source pairs</button></div><pre id="input-metadata"></pre></section>
<section><h2>Choose useful payload fields</h2><p>Original identity, sequence, event type, timing and complete payload remain in the table. Add fields using JSON Pointer paths inside the payload. Exact values stay text; adjacent state columns identify missing, null and JSON kinds.</p>
<details id="payload-explorer"><summary>Explore the original payload fields</summary>
<p>Scan every received event before choosing fields. Coverage describes this complete source window. Short examples are labelled previews; open values to read the complete original value and event identity.</p>
<div class="row"><button id="inspect-fields">Inspect complete source</button><label>Find payload path or type<input id="field-query" type="search" placeholder="/amount, string, null"></label><button id="download-fields">Download complete field catalogue</button></div>
<p id="catalogue-status">Choose a complete retained source pair.</p>
<div class="scroll-table"><table><thead><tr><th>Payload pointer</th><th>Coverage</th><th>Original JSON kinds</th><th>Example preview</th><th></th></tr></thead><tbody id="field-catalogue"></tbody></table></div>
<div class="row"><button id="fields-before">Previous paths</button><button id="fields-after">Next paths</button></div>
<section id="field-values" hidden><h3 id="field-values-title">Original field values</h3><p id="field-values-state"></p><div id="field-values-rows"></div><div class="row"><button id="values-before">Earlier events</button><button id="values-after">Later events</button><button id="download-values">Download these complete values</button></div></section>
</details>
<div class="row"><button id="export-mapping">Download complete mapping</button><label>Mapping for this original source<input id="mapping-file" type="file" accept=".json,application/json"></label><button id="import-mapping">Open selected mapping</button></div>
<table><thead><tr><th>Column name</th><th>Payload pointer</th><th></th></tr></thead><tbody id="fields"></tbody></table>
<div class="row"><button id="add-field">Add field</button><button id="use-accepted">Use accepted field mapping</button><button id="review">Review complete source window</button></div><p id="draft-info"></p></section>
<section id="mapping-continuation"><h2>Continue the mapping across source editions</h2>
<p>Compare the accepted mapping with this received source pair. Cumulative history keeps old paths visible; the new-event columns show what the newly accepted events actually contain. These observations are not a declared source schema.</p>
<div class="row"><button id="compare-mapping">Compare accepted and proposed mappings</button><button id="download-mapping-review">Download complete mapping review</button><label>Open a retained mapping review<input id="mapping-review-file" type="file" accept=".json,application/json"></label><button id="open-mapping-review">Inspect and reopen review</button></div>
<p id="mapping-status">A later window needs an accepted programme and a complete received source pair.</p>
<div id="mapping-summary" class="facts"></div>
<div class="row"><label>Recording reviewer<input id="mapping-reviewer" maxlength="240"></label><label>Reason for this mapping successor<textarea id="mapping-note" rows="3" maxlength="8000"></textarea></label></div>
<div class="scroll-table"><table><thead><tr><th>Output column</th><th>Previous → proposed pointer</th><th>Coverage / observed kinds</th><th>Required decision</th></tr></thead><tbody id="mapping-decisions"></tbody></table></div>
<label>Find a compared pointer<input id="mapping-field-query" type="search"></label><p id="mapping-field-status"></p>
<div class="scroll-table"><table><thead><tr><th>Pointer</th><th>Previous complete window</th><th>Current complete window</th><th>New events only</th><th>Observed change</th></tr></thead><tbody id="mapping-field-rows"></tbody></table></div>
<div class="row"><button id="mapping-fields-before">Previous compared paths</button><button id="mapping-fields-after">Next compared paths</button></div>
<details><summary>Original saved mapping decision for the selected native action</summary><pre id="mapping-native-review"></pre></details>
<p>The downloaded review retains both original source identities, both full mappings, every compared path and the entered decisions. Use the existing complete workspace delivery for both full original source pairs and native history. Reopening validates this review against those retained originals before adopting it.</p></section>
<section><div class="heading"><h2>Review and continue</h2><button id="resume" hidden>Continue original saved action</button></div>
<p id="action-state"></p><div id="review-facts" class="facts"></div><details><summary>Complete selected review and native result</summary><pre id="review-state"></pre></details>
<label>Customer decision or reason for selecting current edits<textarea id="note" rows="3" maxlength="8000"></textarea></label>
<div id="column-choice" hidden><h3>Continue the customer worksheet</h3><p>Review the complete new source and choose each retained worksheet column. Keep the original decision note when continuing this same apply; use Review current customer edits for a deliberately new customer review.</p><div id="worksheet-column-editor"></div><details><summary>Complete native proposal and advanced column input</summary><pre id="column-proposal"></pre><label>Complete native column arrays by worksheet index<textarea id="columns" rows="8" spellcheck="false">{}</textarea></label><button id="load-column-json" type="button">Review these complete column arrays</button></details></div>
<div class="row"><button id="apply">Apply reviewed window</button><button id="refresh-review">Review current customer edits</button><button id="deliver">Prepare complete delivery</button></div><p>When customer work changes during an unfinished selected operation, review those current edits before continuing. The original attempt and decision remain in the programme history.</p>
<div id="downloads"></div></section>
<section><h2>Saved actions</h2><p>Open an original action to read its full result or explicitly continue it after an interruption.</p><table><thead><tr><th>Programme</th><th>Action</th><th>Status</th><th>Saved</th><th></th></tr></thead><tbody id="actions"></tbody></table>
<div class="row"><button id="older-actions">Older actions</button><button id="latest-actions">Latest actions</button></div></section>
</main></body></html>
